# Bundled rime plugins: the explicit contract for lib/rime-plugins/.
#
# package/add_data_files registers ONLY plugins listed here into
# Squirrel.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj. Any unlisted dylib found in
# lib/rime-plugins/ (e.g. a plugin left over from a from-source build that
# the fast path does not ship) is warned about and skipped.
#
# Update this file when the set of plugins shipped by the pinned librime
# release (lua/octagram/predict) or the llm-rerank artifact changes. One
# filename per line; blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
librime-llm-rerank.dylib
librime-lua.dylib
librime-octagram.dylib
librime-predict.dylib
